1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,560
It's been a while, Tanjiro. Long time no see. Feel free to make yourself at home.

2
00:00:08,840 --> 00:00:12,120
It's good to see you too. I'm glad to see you're doing well.

3
00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:20,220
And you too, Tanjiro. At 3 o'clock, I'm going to brew some black tea that'll make us pancakes with lots and lots of butter, okay?

4
00:00:20,680 --> 00:00:25,100
Butter? Pancakes? I barely know what black tea is.

5
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:28,960
We'll have sweets, bread, and pancakes!

6
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:32,800
There you go! Enjoy!

7
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:37,740
Help yourself and dig in!

8
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:40,460
How exactly do I eat something like this?

9
00:00:41,040 --> 00:00:42,380
Here, I'll show you.

10
00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:45,880
Ready, Tanjiro? Open wide!

11
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:47,500
Uh, sure!

12
00:00:52,380 --> 00:00:54,500
Well, what do you think, Tanjiro?

13
00:00:55,620 --> 00:00:57,940
It's so tasty, it's to die for!

14
00:00:57,940 --> 00:01:00,440
It really is delicious, isn't it?

15
00:01:00,440 --> 00:01:01,440
It is!

16
00:01:02,140 --> 00:01:03,440
Oh, and Tanjiro!

17
00:01:03,440 --> 00:01:05,680
When you're done, can you change into this?

18
00:01:05,680 --> 00:01:31,560
Don't you believe me?

19
00:01:31,560 --> 00:01:32,580
Yeah.

20
00:02:01,560 --> 00:02:03,560
Oh

21
00:02:31,560 --> 00:02:42,560
Ready

22
00:02:42,560 --> 00:02:44,460
All right

23
00:02:44,460 --> 00:02:46,460
Try to stay in sync everybody

24
00:02:46,460 --> 00:02:48,720
Extend those arms more

25
00:02:48,720 --> 00:02:50,880
Jump as far as you can

26
00:02:50,880 --> 00:02:52,100
Good

27
00:02:52,100 --> 00:02:53,740
Now twirl all the way around

28
00:02:53,740 --> 00:03:00,360
It's important that you stay flexible

29
00:03:00,360 --> 00:03:02,740
It'll help make all your movements more snappy

30
00:03:02,740 --> 00:03:05,200
So limber up everyone

31
00:03:05,200 --> 00:03:07,040
And give me a big stretch

32
00:03:07,040 --> 00:03:10,920
No that's not how I taught you

33
00:03:10,920 --> 00:03:12,900
I'll show you how it's done

34
00:03:12,900 --> 00:03:14,000
Let's switch

35
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:18,420
Here we go

36
00:03:18,420 --> 00:03:22,880
Take it there

37
00:03:22,880 --> 00:03:25,460
This isn't limbering up

38
00:03:25,460 --> 00:03:26,340
It's torture

39
00:03:26,340 --> 00:03:27,860
All right

40
00:03:27,860 --> 00:03:31,040
Come on it's your turn now Tanjiro

41
00:03:31,040 --> 00:03:31,540
What?

42
00:03:32,680 --> 00:03:33,940
Are you ready?

43
00:03:34,240 --> 00:03:35,660
Here we go

44
00:03:35,660 --> 00:03:37,540
Flexibility is

45
00:03:37,540 --> 00:03:39,320
Help

46
00:03:39,320 --> 00:03:48,880
Hello Tanjiro Kamado

47
00:03:48,880 --> 00:03:52,180
I've been waiting for you here for some time

48
00:03:52,180 --> 00:04:00,940
I can't wait to train

49
00:04:00,940 --> 00:04:01,400
Shut up

50
00:04:01,400 --> 00:04:02,540
Or I'll kill you

51
00:04:02,540 --> 00:04:06,600
Kanroji told me all about you in a letter

52
00:04:06,600 --> 00:04:09,540
And judging by what she said

53
00:04:09,540 --> 00:04:12,560
It sounds like it was awfully fun training under her

54
00:04:12,560 --> 00:04:13,200
Huh?

55
00:04:15,140 --> 00:04:17,900
I bet you had all sorts of fun didn't you?

56
00:04:18,440 --> 00:04:20,640
I've got a letter for you from Lady Kanroji

57
00:04:20,640 --> 00:04:25,140
Dear Mr. Igaro

58
00:04:25,140 --> 00:04:26,180
How are you?

59
00:04:26,700 --> 00:04:27,840
After training today

60
00:04:27,840 --> 00:04:30,440
I sat down and had black tea with Tanjiro

61
00:04:30,440 --> 00:04:32,660
Tanjiro's so cute

62
00:04:32,660 --> 00:04:34,780
Whenever he eats or drinks something sweet

63
00:04:34,780 --> 00:04:36,660
He looks like he died and went to heaven

64
00:04:36,660 --> 00:04:38,040
Isn't that adorable?

65
00:04:41,320 --> 00:04:41,720
Kamado

66
00:04:41,720 --> 00:04:42,220
No

67
00:04:42,220 --> 00:04:48,100
I won't go easy on you like Kanroji did

68
00:04:48,100 --> 00:04:48,860
Understand

69
00:04:48,860 --> 00:04:53,100
It's day one and he already hates me with a burning passion

70
00:04:53,100 --> 00:04:57,180
This is the training I have in store for you

71
00:04:57,180 --> 00:05:07,060
I'm going to have you strike targets I've placed

72
00:05:07,060 --> 00:05:09,560
While avoiding these whiny obstacles

73
00:05:09,560 --> 00:05:13,060
To refine your swordsmanship skills

74
00:05:13,060 --> 00:05:14,260
Okay

75
00:05:14,260 --> 00:05:17,140
But why does this feel more like

76
00:05:17,140 --> 00:05:19,580
An execution ground

77
00:05:19,580 --> 00:05:22,980
So the people who are tied up in here

78
00:05:22,980 --> 00:05:25,000
Did they commit a crime or something?

79
00:05:25,560 --> 00:05:27,620
I suppose you could say that

80
00:05:27,620 --> 00:05:29,620
The crime of weakness

81
00:05:29,620 --> 00:05:31,580
The crime of incompetence

82
00:05:31,580 --> 00:05:33,420
The crime of wasting my time

83
00:05:33,420 --> 00:05:35,320
The crime of annoying me

84
00:05:35,320 --> 00:05:36,900
They're lucky to be alive

85
00:05:36,900 --> 00:05:38,320
Oh no

86
00:05:38,320 --> 00:05:39,940
What am I gonna do?

87
00:05:40,480 --> 00:05:41,780
You'll be using this

88
00:05:41,780 --> 00:05:45,320
I'm only showing you once

89
00:05:45,320 --> 00:05:46,360
So pay attention

90
00:05:46,360 --> 00:05:58,360
And that's it

91
00:05:58,360 --> 00:06:00,940
To be so accurate

92
00:06:00,940 --> 00:06:02,140
While navigating the space

93
00:06:02,140 --> 00:06:03,220
Between all the swordsmen

94
00:06:03,220 --> 00:06:04,120
At such speed

95
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:07,360
Let's see you do it

96
00:06:07,360 --> 00:06:11,360
Please don't hit me

97
00:06:11,360 --> 00:06:13,360
Please don't hit me

98
00:06:13,360 --> 00:06:16,960
Please don't hit us

99
00:06:16,960 --> 00:06:19,000
Please don't hit us

100
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:22,380
Get on with it already

101
00:06:22,380 --> 00:06:23,020
Right

102
00:06:23,020 --> 00:06:37,040
What an absolute joke

103
00:06:37,040 --> 00:06:39,900
You called that sad display training

104
00:06:39,900 --> 00:06:45,240
I'll take you on myself then

105
00:06:45,240 --> 00:06:47,580
Now strike me

106
00:06:47,580 --> 00:06:49,720
Strike you?

107
00:06:50,720 --> 00:06:51,660
Right

108
00:06:51,660 --> 00:06:56,080
Please don't hit me

109
00:06:56,080 --> 00:07:01,320
You hesitated

110
00:07:01,320 --> 00:07:06,260
My hands are totally tied

111
00:07:06,260 --> 00:07:10,060
Again

112
00:07:10,060 --> 00:07:12,740
Cramped space or not

113
00:07:12,740 --> 00:07:14,700
I have to land a strike

114
00:07:14,700 --> 00:07:17,740
You're slow

115
00:07:17,740 --> 00:07:20,340
It's no good

116
00:07:20,340 --> 00:07:22,240
I'm too worried about hitting

117
00:07:22,240 --> 00:07:23,440
One of the other swordsmen

118
00:07:23,440 --> 00:07:25,480
Stand up

119
00:07:25,480 --> 00:07:27,460
Start over from the beginning

120
00:07:27,460 --> 00:07:32,040
And so the most terrifying training began

121
00:07:32,040 --> 00:07:34,360
I may be using a wooden sword

122
00:07:34,360 --> 00:07:36,520
But it could still cause serious injury

123
00:07:36,520 --> 00:07:39,520
I have to maneuver between these poor swordsmen

124
00:07:39,520 --> 00:07:41,280
While dodging Mr. Iguro's attacks

125
00:07:41,280 --> 00:07:42,960
This is dangerous

126
00:07:42,960 --> 00:07:45,340
Especially since his sword strikes

127
00:07:45,340 --> 00:07:47,600
Twist and turn in such an abnormal way

128
00:07:47,600 --> 00:07:51,520
You're slow

129
00:07:51,520 --> 00:07:54,860
We're both wielding the same kind of sword

130
00:07:54,860 --> 00:07:56,900
So how can his bend like that?

131
00:07:57,980 --> 00:08:00,160
His strikes are able to weave and slither

132
00:08:00,160 --> 00:08:01,420
Their way past obstacles

133
00:08:01,420 --> 00:08:03,040
Just like a serpent

134
00:08:03,040 --> 00:08:04,860
What's worse

135
00:08:04,860 --> 00:08:06,560
I can't unhear them

136
00:08:06,560 --> 00:08:08,180
The muffled cries for help

137
00:08:08,180 --> 00:08:09,180
From my fellow trainees

138
00:08:09,180 --> 00:08:10,860
As I swing past them

139
00:08:10,860 --> 00:08:13,160
Please, please, please, please, please

140
00:08:13,160 --> 00:08:16,160
They're saying please don't hit me

141
00:08:16,160 --> 00:08:18,440
I can hear every plea

142
00:08:18,440 --> 00:08:20,280
And each one pierces my soul

143
00:08:20,280 --> 00:08:22,360
Don't hesitate

144
00:08:22,360 --> 00:08:23,660
You piece of trash

145
00:08:23,660 --> 00:08:26,220
I've never felt tension like this

146
00:08:26,220 --> 00:08:28,220
My hands couldn't stop shaking

147
00:08:28,220 --> 00:08:31,040
If I don't swing my sword with pinpoint accuracy

148
00:08:31,040 --> 00:08:32,600
Someone could really get hurt

149
00:08:32,600 --> 00:08:35,220
Sorry

150
00:08:35,220 --> 00:08:45,760
Hey, Kamado

151
00:08:45,760 --> 00:08:47,640
How are you able to keep going

152
00:08:47,640 --> 00:08:49,580
After training so hard with the Hashira?

153
00:08:49,580 --> 00:08:56,380
Because if I miss once

154
00:08:56,380 --> 00:08:58,840
I could injure one of you

155
00:08:58,840 --> 00:09:05,020
Come on, you guys

156
00:09:05,020 --> 00:09:06,260
Let's join it

157
00:09:06,260 --> 00:09:08,140
Yeah, why not?

158
00:09:15,340 --> 00:09:16,100
Oh, no

159
00:09:16,100 --> 00:09:18,160
This will make our cut sting, won't it?

160
00:09:19,600 --> 00:09:21,280
How bad could it be?

161
00:09:22,940 --> 00:09:23,780
All right

162
00:09:23,780 --> 00:09:25,380
Here it goes

163
00:09:25,380 --> 00:09:26,180
You sure?

164
00:09:26,880 --> 00:09:27,780
We'll go together

165
00:09:27,780 --> 00:09:30,380
Ready, set

166
00:09:30,380 --> 00:09:37,360
That really stings

167
00:09:37,360 --> 00:09:43,500
Still slow

168
00:09:43,500 --> 00:09:46,360
If you're going to strike at that speed

169
00:09:46,360 --> 00:09:47,620
This drill is pointless

170
00:09:47,620 --> 00:09:48,740
Yes, sir

171
00:09:48,740 --> 00:09:54,260
Now you're lunging even slower

172
00:09:54,260 --> 00:09:55,160
Get a grip

173
00:09:55,160 --> 00:09:59,920
It stings

174
00:09:59,920 --> 00:10:04,960
You're slow

175
00:10:04,960 --> 00:10:06,640
You're slow

176
00:10:06,640 --> 00:10:09,060
You're too slow

177
00:10:09,060 --> 00:10:12,060
Ouch

178
00:10:12,060 --> 00:10:13,240
It stings

179
00:10:13,240 --> 00:10:21,680
What's wrong?

180
00:10:21,920 --> 00:10:23,500
Have you given up, slowpoke?

181
00:10:28,380 --> 00:10:31,280
I've got to focus solely on battling Mr. Igoro

182
00:10:31,280 --> 00:10:33,260
In a real fight

183
00:10:33,260 --> 00:10:35,300
If your sword gets caught on something

184
00:10:35,300 --> 00:10:36,000
It's fatal

185
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:38,240
Avoid all the obstacles

186
00:10:38,240 --> 00:10:39,380
And swing your sword

187
00:10:39,380 --> 00:10:41,340
It's as simple as that

188
00:10:41,340 --> 00:10:54,980
My strikes are becoming more accurate

189
00:10:54,980 --> 00:10:56,620
I'm getting the hang of it

190
00:10:56,620 --> 00:11:06,120
I can evade Mr. Igoro's attacks

191
00:11:06,120 --> 00:11:10,120
And because of my training

192
00:11:10,120 --> 00:11:11,540
Land my own

193
00:11:11,540 --> 00:11:18,900
Once you land a strike

194
00:11:18,900 --> 00:11:24,260
And slash one of Mr. Igoro's Hauri sleeves

195
00:11:24,260 --> 00:11:28,120
They say that you're finished with his training

196
00:11:28,120 --> 00:11:31,820
Thank you for your hard work

197
00:11:31,820 --> 00:11:33,840
Leave my sight

198
00:11:33,840 --> 00:11:36,820
Before I change my mind and kill you

199
00:11:36,820 --> 00:11:39,680
And stop getting chummy with Konroji, brat

200
00:11:39,680 --> 00:11:43,660
It makes me sad to know that he hated me from start to finish

201
00:11:43,660 --> 00:11:44,940
What'd I do?

202
00:11:48,940 --> 00:11:49,940
Let's see

203
00:11:49,940 --> 00:11:53,120
Mr. Shinazugawa's dojo is this way

204
00:11:53,120 --> 00:11:54,420
Birdbrain!

205
00:11:54,580 --> 00:11:56,140
You're supposed to turn right here!

206
00:11:56,360 --> 00:11:57,600
How dumb can you be?

207
00:11:57,900 --> 00:11:59,900
Oh, we turned right there, huh?

208
00:12:02,280 --> 00:12:04,540
Whoa!

209
00:12:05,120 --> 00:12:05,680
Zenitsu!

210
00:12:05,680 --> 00:12:08,540
I'm begging you, please help me escape!

211
00:12:08,720 --> 00:12:10,860
Tanju, Tanju, you gotta help me!

212
00:12:10,860 --> 00:12:12,360
Help you escape from what?

213
00:12:12,420 --> 00:12:14,800
I'm not even able to stay upright anymore!

214
00:12:15,180 --> 00:12:17,580
It took me forever just to get this far away!

215
00:12:17,900 --> 00:12:19,660
I had to crawl along the walls!

216
00:12:19,860 --> 00:12:21,600
Masking my presence like a lizard!

217
00:12:22,100 --> 00:12:23,460
My life is on the line!

218
00:12:23,620 --> 00:12:24,480
Please help me!

219
00:12:24,480 --> 00:12:34,360
Make up your mind!

220
00:12:34,760 --> 00:12:36,200
Either come back to training

221
00:12:36,200 --> 00:12:38,260
Or be killed where you stand!

222
00:12:39,200 --> 00:12:41,520
Please spare my pathetic life!

223
00:12:42,400 --> 00:12:43,420
Please calm down!

224
00:12:46,240 --> 00:12:47,240
Shut up!

225
00:12:50,440 --> 00:12:51,420
Carry him

226
00:12:51,420 --> 00:12:52,660
Uh, yes, sir!

227
00:12:52,660 --> 00:12:55,760
Sorry, Zenitsu

228
00:12:55,760 --> 00:12:57,700
We'll get through this together

229
00:12:57,700 --> 00:13:01,040
Long time no see!

230
00:13:01,500 --> 00:13:03,460
I'll be training under you starting today!

231
00:13:04,020 --> 00:13:05,240
I can hardly wait!

232
00:13:07,620 --> 00:13:09,300
Don't get too cocky, kid

233
00:13:09,300 --> 00:13:14,000
I haven't deemed you worthy of my respect, you got that?

234
00:13:14,440 --> 00:13:16,120
That doesn't bother me at all!

235
00:13:16,460 --> 00:13:18,280
See, I actually don't respect you either!

236
00:13:19,220 --> 00:13:20,380
You stabbed Nezuko!

237
00:13:20,380 --> 00:13:31,240
You've got some nerve

238
00:13:31,240 --> 00:13:44,300
Come on, come on, come on, come on!

239
00:13:44,300 --> 00:13:54,900
Mr. Shinazugawa's drills were so harsh, I could understand why Zenitsu ended up like that

240
00:13:54,900 --> 00:13:59,860
It was a simple striking drill in which we all took turns assaulting Mr. Shinazugawa

241
00:13:59,860 --> 00:14:02,620
We had no choice but to keep going

242
00:14:02,620 --> 00:14:05,400
Until we spewed vomit or passed out

243
00:14:05,400 --> 00:14:08,860
To make matters worse, there were no breaks

244
00:14:08,860 --> 00:14:12,620
Even Mr. Igorou let us rest a little bit

245
00:14:12,620 --> 00:14:13,500
Hmm

246
00:14:13,500 --> 00:14:19,220
When Zenitsu came too, he berated me as if he were avenging his parents' death

247
00:14:19,220 --> 00:14:21,480
I hate you, you jerk!

248
00:14:21,480 --> 00:14:23,400
Ow, ow, I'm sorry!

249
00:14:24,680 --> 00:14:27,820
Mr. Shinazugawa was especially harsh on me

250
00:14:27,820 --> 00:14:32,920
If I had let my guard down for even a second, I would have ended up right back in treatment

251
00:14:32,920 --> 00:14:37,820
I can't start my training here like this

252
00:14:37,820 --> 00:14:42,060
Battered, bruised, and covered in my own vomit

253
00:14:42,060 --> 00:14:43,820
It's soul-crushing

254
00:14:43,820 --> 00:14:46,200
Big bro, wait up!

255
00:14:46,940 --> 00:14:47,740
Kenya's here?

256
00:14:50,380 --> 00:14:52,220
There's something I want to tell you

257
00:14:52,220 --> 00:14:55,020
Learn some boundaries

258
00:14:55,020 --> 00:14:58,300
And I don't recall having a younger brother

259
00:14:58,300 --> 00:15:05,060
If you don't give me some space, I'll eviscerate you

260
00:15:05,060 --> 00:15:14,580
That's not like the sibling fights we had

261
00:15:14,580 --> 00:15:16,900
Do you surrender?

262
00:15:17,900 --> 00:15:19,620
Cut it out, big brother!

263
00:15:20,740 --> 00:15:24,440
Stop talking to me like we're close or something, you freak

264
00:15:24,440 --> 00:15:29,580
Judging by the looks of you, you're useless

265
00:15:29,580 --> 00:15:32,120
And if you don't have any skills to show

266
00:15:32,120 --> 00:15:34,380
Then quit the Demon Slayer core

267
00:15:34,380 --> 00:15:37,260
You can't even use breathing techniques, right?

268
00:15:37,560 --> 00:15:39,220
And you're not a real swordsman

269
00:15:39,220 --> 00:15:40,820
I can't, but

270
00:15:40,820 --> 00:15:45,700
Hey, hold on before you go

271
00:15:45,700 --> 00:15:49,840
I've been wanting to apologize to you all this time

272
00:15:49,840 --> 00:15:51,040
That's it, Kenya

273
00:15:51,040 --> 00:15:52,240
Don't give up

274
00:15:52,240 --> 00:15:55,320
I really couldn't care less

275
00:15:55,320 --> 00:15:56,880
Now get lost

276
00:15:56,880 --> 00:16:01,360
But brother

277
00:16:01,360 --> 00:16:05,300
I've even eaten demons

278
00:16:05,300 --> 00:16:09,020
Just to be able to fight

279
00:16:09,020 --> 00:16:15,400
You what?

280
00:16:16,620 --> 00:16:19,020
What did you just say?

281
00:16:21,140 --> 00:16:22,860
You bastard

282
00:16:22,860 --> 00:16:24,520
Demons?

283
00:16:24,520 --> 00:16:34,300
You've eaten demons

284
00:16:34,300 --> 00:16:37,640
He's gone

285
00:16:37,640 --> 00:16:38,460
Genya

286
00:16:38,460 --> 00:16:50,240
How many more days is this torture gonna last, huh?

287
00:16:50,240 --> 00:16:56,500
He's back

288
00:16:56,500 --> 00:16:57,540
He's back, he's back, he's back

289
00:16:57,540 --> 00:16:59,580
Quick, lie down and pretend you passed out

290
00:16:59,580 --> 00:17:01,580
It's the only way we'll be spared

291
00:17:01,580 --> 00:17:07,120
Is that Tanjiro?

292
00:17:07,120 --> 00:17:08,580
What the?

293
00:17:08,580 --> 00:17:10,420
You'll be killed, Tanjiro

294
00:17:10,420 --> 00:17:13,100
What are you doing destroying the building like that?

295
00:17:13,680 --> 00:17:14,960
Please, calm down

296
00:17:14,960 --> 00:17:20,560
Hold on

297
00:17:20,560 --> 00:17:23,840
What's that twisted, ominous sound that's coming from inside?

298
00:17:23,840 --> 00:17:31,600
The old guy's on a rampage

299
00:17:31,600 --> 00:17:34,200
We're getting clobbered during and after training

300
00:17:34,200 --> 00:17:36,440
What do you think you're doing?

301
00:17:36,780 --> 00:17:38,080
You could have killed him

302
00:17:38,080 --> 00:17:41,040
If I wanted him dead, he would be

303
00:17:41,040 --> 00:17:43,440
We're not allowed to kill trainees

304
00:17:43,440 --> 00:17:45,640
But I have something else planned

305
00:17:45,640 --> 00:17:48,840
I'm going to break him beyond recovery

306
00:17:48,840 --> 00:17:50,600
I tell you what

307
00:17:50,600 --> 00:17:53,640
If he quits the Demon Slayer Corps right here and now

308
00:17:53,640 --> 00:17:54,600
I'll let him go

309
00:17:54,600 --> 00:17:56,340
How dare you?

310
00:17:56,900 --> 00:17:58,940
There's no way you have that kind of authority

311
00:17:58,940 --> 00:18:01,080
You can't force him to quit

312
00:18:01,080 --> 00:18:04,000
And you just said yourself that you had no brother

313
00:18:04,000 --> 00:18:07,420
So you have no say in what choices Genya makes

314
00:18:07,420 --> 00:18:09,380
Whether he has skills or not

315
00:18:09,380 --> 00:18:12,200
He's decided to risk his life fighting demons

316
00:18:12,200 --> 00:18:13,920
If you're not his brother

317
00:18:13,920 --> 00:18:16,480
Then I'm not letting you stand in his way

318
00:18:16,480 --> 00:18:20,340
Without Genya, that upper rank would have beaten us

319
00:18:20,340 --> 00:18:23,180
So I won't let you hurt him

320
00:18:23,180 --> 00:18:24,560
Genya's my friend

321
00:18:24,560 --> 00:18:27,800
Is that right?

322
00:18:29,480 --> 00:18:33,140
Then I'll just go ahead and break you beyond recovery first

323
00:18:33,140 --> 00:18:37,840
Here he comes

324
00:18:37,840 --> 00:18:39,220
Focus

325
00:18:39,220 --> 00:18:44,720
Tanjiro

326
00:18:44,720 --> 00:18:47,320
Damn brat

327
00:18:47,320 --> 00:18:49,560
He stopped my fist

328
00:18:49,560 --> 00:18:55,880
He landed a blow

329
00:18:55,880 --> 00:18:59,080
Zenitsu

330
00:18:59,080 --> 00:19:01,520
Get Genya out of here quickly

331
00:19:01,520 --> 00:19:03,240
Are you stupid or something?

332
00:19:03,500 --> 00:19:05,340
Don't call me by my name in front of him

333
00:19:05,340 --> 00:19:07,780
There's gotta be a better way to signal to me

334
00:19:07,780 --> 00:19:08,580
Tanjiro

335
00:19:08,580 --> 00:19:16,580
He only grazed me but that kick ripped my ear

336
00:19:16,580 --> 00:19:20,500
You've really got some nerve taking me on like this

337
00:19:20,500 --> 00:19:22,680
If you've got a death wish

338
00:19:22,680 --> 00:19:25,540
I'd love to help you out with that

339
00:19:25,540 --> 00:19:27,020
Stop it brother

340
00:19:27,020 --> 00:19:29,120
You got nothing to do with this

341
00:19:29,120 --> 00:19:30,220
Let's go

342
00:19:30,220 --> 00:19:32,240
Who are you?

343
00:19:32,340 --> 00:19:33,180
Let go of me

344
00:19:33,180 --> 00:19:36,800
The enemy won't be able to focus on us all at once if we split up

345
00:19:36,800 --> 00:19:38,520
So that guy's your big brother?

346
00:19:38,600 --> 00:19:39,180
He's a total lunatic

347
00:19:39,760 --> 00:19:41,180
I feel bad you had to

348
00:19:41,720 --> 00:19:44,480
Don't you dare insult my older brother

349
00:19:44,480 --> 00:19:46,340
I'm on your side you idiot

350
00:19:46,340 --> 00:19:47,940
Just die already

351
00:19:47,940 --> 00:19:54,400
From that point on it was a frenzy of chaos and turmoil

352
00:19:54,400 --> 00:19:58,400
The brawl nearly lasted until dusk

353
00:19:58,400 --> 00:20:01,580
What were you thinking back there you idiot?

354
00:20:01,820 --> 00:20:04,680
I received a formal reprimand from the higher ups

355
00:20:04,680 --> 00:20:07,400
My training under the wind Hashira was suspended

356
00:20:07,400 --> 00:20:10,160
And I was banned from going near him again

357
00:20:10,160 --> 00:20:14,820
In the end

358
00:20:14,820 --> 00:20:20,580
I wasn't able to bring the Shinazugawa brothers together as I'd hoped

359
00:20:20,580 --> 00:20:27,620
Not only did I get us kicked out of his training sessions

360
00:20:27,620 --> 00:20:30,280
But my mark still isn't any clearer

361
00:20:30,280 --> 00:20:33,100
And I feel like I haven't grown at all from my training

362
00:20:33,100 --> 00:20:34,920
You definitely have

363
00:20:34,920 --> 00:20:37,740
After all you took on the old wind guy right?

364
00:20:38,160 --> 00:20:39,120
That's incredible

365
00:20:39,120 --> 00:20:40,660
You really think so?

366
00:20:40,660 --> 00:20:43,660
Just how deep in the mountains is the Stonehengeur's house?

367
00:20:43,860 --> 00:20:44,740
Is he a hermit?

368
00:20:44,900 --> 00:20:46,360
I think it's just a bit farther

369
00:20:46,360 --> 00:20:47,240
What?

370
00:20:47,820 --> 00:20:49,120
Is something wrong?

371
00:20:49,740 --> 00:20:51,220
I hear something up ahead

372
00:20:51,220 --> 00:20:53,080
This way

373
00:20:53,080 --> 00:20:59,320
It's a waterfall

374
00:20:59,320 --> 00:21:03,200
Hey look

375
00:21:03,200 --> 00:21:08,900
Thus have I heard in the presence of the Buddha

376
00:21:08,900 --> 00:21:17,180
If you are able to extinguish your heart and mind

377
00:21:17,180 --> 00:21:20,900
Even fire becomes tolerable

378
00:21:20,900 --> 00:21:27,100
Welcome boys

379
00:21:27,100 --> 00:21:29,180
To my training ground

380
00:21:29,180 --> 00:21:41,840
Our Luna is Heights

381
00:21:41,840 --> 00:21:42,100
This made us look

382
00:21:42,100 --> 00:21:43,560
Once again

383
00:21:43,560 --> 00:21:44,120
We're here

384
00:21:44,120 --> 00:21:45,600
Listen

385
00:21:45,600 --> 00:21:47,440
By one

386
00:21:47,440 --> 00:21:47,980
Where

387
00:21:47,980 --> 00:21:48,860
We're here

388
00:21:48,860 --> 00:21:49,340
Full

389
00:21:49,760 --> 00:21:51,660
Let's

390
00:21:51,660 --> 00:21:52,540
Let's

391
00:21:52,540 --> 00:22:22,440
I'll hit you later.

392
00:22:22,540 --> 00:22:52,520
Thank you.

393
00:22:52,540 --> 00:23:04,420
Today, we're talking about Mr. Iguro.

394
00:23:05,000 --> 00:23:06,340
You're still here?

395
00:23:06,620 --> 00:23:09,220
You better not be making a pass at Kanroji.

396
00:23:09,420 --> 00:23:10,440
It's not like that!

397
00:23:10,520 --> 00:23:12,180
And I'm telling a Taisho era secret!

398
00:23:13,240 --> 00:23:14,980
Then get it over with.

399
00:23:15,680 --> 00:23:18,000
All right, here's a Taisho era secret.

400
00:23:18,320 --> 00:23:22,000
The name of the snake Mr. Iguro has is Kaburamaru.

401
00:23:22,540 --> 00:23:25,920
He says that his left and right eyes have been different colors since birth.

402
00:23:26,580 --> 00:23:31,000
If that's everything, then get out of here and stay away from Kanroji.

403
00:23:31,320 --> 00:23:32,300
But we're friends.

404
00:23:32,700 --> 00:23:34,840
So you are planning on seeing her.

405
00:23:35,700 --> 00:23:36,060
Whoa!

406
00:23:36,500 --> 00:23:39,080
Episode 6, the strongest of the Demon Slayer Corps!

